  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PASSIVE has the value 0x4</p>
  <p>If it is contained in the result of llDetectedType(), it means it is non-physical objects.</p>
  <p>If it is used as an filter of llSensor() or llSensorRepeat(), it will search for non-scripted or script is inactive and non-physical or, if physical, not moving. Thus, it is not using SL server resources now.</p>
</p>
